        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/GTA-Online-6_vy3MsZh.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>Rockstar has remained very tight-lipped about <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/gta-6-everything-we-know-so-far-9357\">GTA 6</a>'s multiplayer component, the potential successor to <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/games/grand-theft-auto-v\">GTA 5</a>'s incredibly popular <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/games/gta-online\">Grand Theft Auto Online</a>, not yet commenting on whether it will even launch one. All we know currently is that when Grand Theft Auto 6 <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/gta-6-is-up-for-pre-order\">arrives on 19th November</a>, it'll only include the single-player campaign.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/gta-6-online-release-date-twitch-ceo\">Read more</a></p>",
